  "description": "So-Yu ends up raising a child named Yeo-Ul after a night of passion. Having disappeared from the public eye following her father’s death, she reunites, as if by fate, five years later with Jin-Uk, her childhood friend and a famous film director. The moment he saw Yeo-Ul, Jin-Uk instinctively knew he was his son. To win over So-Yu, who immediately drew a line between them, and be accepted as his real father, he sets out on a head-on journey, staking his entire life on it. \n\n*“Am I... the Dad?”\n\n“Yes. It’s you.”*\n\nThe story of “Capital F’s” relentless struggle to win over “Capital T’s” heart and become a father.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
